  "TOOL: Raise Heights\n\nDrag left click on the map ground to elevate terrain. Adjust size and strength in settings.": "TOOL: Raise Heights\n\nDrag left click on the map ground to elevate terrain. Adjust size and strength in settings.",
  "TOOL: Ramping\n\nLeft-click once on the terrain to set the Ramp Start Point. Left-click again to set the Ramp End Point. The tool will smoothly interpolate heights between the two points. Press Right-click or Escape to cancel.": "TOOL: Ramping\n\nLeft-click once on the terrain to set the Ramp Start Point. Left-click again to set the Ramp End Point. The tool will smoothly interpolate heights between the two points. Press Right-click or Escape to cancel.",
  "TOOL: Lower Heights\n\nDrag left click on the map ground to depress terrain. Adjust size and strength in settings.": "TOOL: Lower Heights\n\nDrag left click on the map ground to depress terrain. Adjust size and strength in settings.",
  "TOOL: Flatten Heights\n\nDrag left click to snap terrain heights toward the target Flatten Height slider value.": "TOOL: Flatten Heights\n\nDrag left click to snap terrain heights toward the target Flatten Height slider value.",
  "TOOL: Smooth Terrain\n\nDrag left click to average neighbor vertex heights and smooth out rugged elevations.": "TOOL: Smooth Terrain\n\nDrag left click to average neighbor vertex heights and smooth out rugged elevations.",
  "TOOL: Cliff / Terrace\n\nDrag left click to create flat terraced steps. Hold Shift to lower the target cliff level.": "TOOL: Cliff / Terrace\n\nDrag left click to create flat terraced steps. Hold Shift to lower the target cliff level.",
  "TOOL: Texture Painting\n\nDrag left click to paint texture layers onto the vertices of the terrain mesh.": "TOOL: Texture Painting\n\nDrag left click to paint texture layers onto the vertices of the terrain mesh.",
  "TOOL: Flood Fill\n\nClick once on the terrain map to flood-fill an area sharing the same texture color until hitting a boundary (cliff or different texture). Uses selected texture swatch.": "TOOL: Flood Fill\n\nClick once on the terrain map to flood-fill an area sharing the same texture color until hitting a boundary (cliff or different texture). Uses selected texture swatch.",
  "TOOL: Area Select\n\nDrag left click to select a rectangular area of the map. Press Ctrl+C to copy the area.": "TOOL: Area Select\n\nDrag left click to select a rectangular area of the map. Press Ctrl+C to copy the area.",
  "TOOL: Area Paste\n\nClick on the terrain to paste the copied area. Use the Paste Contents Options checkboxes to filter what is pasted (Textures, Heights, Entities).": "TOOL: Area Paste\n\nClick on the terrain to paste the copied area. Use the Paste Contents Options checkboxes to filter what is pasted (Textures, Heights, Entities).",
  "TOOL: Place Unit\n\nLeft-click on the ground to spawn a {0} aligned with {1}.": "TOOL: Place Unit\n\nLeft-click on the ground to spawn a {0} aligned with {1}.",
  "TOOL: Place Prop\n\nLeft-click on the ground to spawn static decorative object: {0}.": "TOOL: Place Prop\n\nLeft-click on the ground to spawn static decorative object: {0}.",
  "TOOL: Clump Brush\n\nDrag left click on the ground to paint clumps of static props: {0} based on Density and Scale Variation settings. Uses texture brush shape (Circle/Square).": "TOOL: Clump Brush\n\nDrag left click on the ground to paint clumps of static props: {0} based on Density and Scale Variation settings. Uses texture brush shape (Circle/Square).",
  "TOOL: Place Decal\n\nLeft-click on the ground to project a decorative decal. Snapping, scaling, and rotation apply.": "TOOL: Place Decal\n\nLeft-click on the ground to project a decorative decal. Snapping, scaling, and rotation apply.",
  "TOOL: Object Eraser\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit or prop in 3D scene to erase and remove it from the map.": "TOOL: Object Eraser\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit or prop in 3D scene to erase and remove it from the map.",
  "TOOL: Select / Move\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit, prop, or decal to select it. Hold and drag left click to move it. Use R to rotate, S to scale, or Delete/Backspace to delete.": "TOOL: Select / Move\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit, prop, or decal to select it. Hold and drag left click to move it. Use R to rotate, S to scale, or Delete/Backspace to delete.",
  "TOOL: Eyedropper / Picker\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit, prop, or decal to copy and select it as the active placement tool. Click on terrain to copy its texture color, or hold Shift to copy its height.": "TOOL: Eyedropper / Picker\n\nLeft-click directly on any unit, prop, or decal to copy and select it as the active placement tool. Click on terrain to copy its texture color, or hold Shift to copy its height.",
  "TOOL: Roughen Terrain\n\nDrag left-click to apply random height variations/noise to ruggedize the terrain surface. Adjust size and strength in settings.": "TOOL: Roughen Terrain\n\nDrag left-click to apply random height variations/noise to ruggedize the terrain surface. Adjust size and strength in settings.",
  "TOOL: Pathing Layer Painting\n\nDrag left click to paint pathing properties (ground, flying, water, etc.) onto the map. Use checkboxes to select layers, and Mode to Add/Remove.": "TOOL: Pathing Layer Painting\n\nDrag left click to paint pathing properties (ground, flying, water, etc.) onto the map. Use checkboxes to select layers, and Mode to Add/Remove.",
