  "AGREEMENT_SOLO_TITLE": "- Going Solo",
  "AGREEMENT_SOLO_BODY": "Want to turn your map into a standalone game? Go for it! However, you can only take your original work with you. You must remove and re-create any official Realm assets as well as content you imported from other Realm users, unless you obtain their explicit written permission.",
